WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.357
Roxy took a step. Bam!

2
00:00:04.358 --> 00:00:06.176
She hit a mirror.

3
00:00:06.177 --> 00:00:08.809
All of her reflections rubbed their heads.

4
00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:15.240
"Ugh! I'm stuck in an enormous mirror maze!"

5
00:00:15.241 --> 00:00:20.000
"Yes, you are!" Jack Hammer appeared in the mirrors.

6
00:00:20.001 --> 00:00:24.010
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

7
00:00:24.011 --> 00:00:27.957
Ping! Ping! The beams bounced off the mirrors.

8
00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:30.829
Roxy ducked as they passed by her head.

9
00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:39.516
Jack Hammer laughed. "So long, Rocket Girl!"

10
00:00:39.517 --> 00:00:43.183
Roxy banged into mirrors again and again. After

11
00:00:43.184 --> 00:00:48.639
a few minutes, she was still in the maze. "How

12
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:52.491
will I get out of here?" Roxy thought. Then

13
00:00:52.492 --> 00:00:55.770
she had an idea. She

14
00:00:55.771 --> 00:01:00.377
blew her freeze breath. The

15
00:01:00.378 --> 00:01:03.007
mirrors filled with frost. Cracks

16
00:01:03.008 --> 00:01:08.218
crept along the glass, and then— smash!

17
00:01:08.219 --> 00:01:11.591
The mirrors shattered.

18
00:01:11.592 --> 00:01:17.648
Roxy saw an exit sign. "Yes!"

19
00:01:17.649 --> 00:01:23.285
*** Metro City Elementary School was empty when Roxy

20
00:01:23.286 --> 00:01:26.842
arrived. She called Terrell's

21
00:01:26.843 --> 00:01:33.281
phone. Using her super hearing, she heard it

22
00:01:33.282 --> 00:01:35.950
ringing. Roxy rushed to the phone and

23
00:01:35.951 --> 00:01:40.145
sighed. It was in their classroom, inside Terrell's

24
00:01:40.146 --> 00:01:44.069
backpack. Terrell, however, wasn't

25
00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:49.655
there. Walking through the school, Roxy used her super hearing

26
00:01:49.656 --> 00:01:52.699
again. She heard voices directly under the

27
00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.863
gym. Roxy punched through the

28
00:01:54.864 --> 00:01:57.775
floor. Beneath the floor there was an enormous

29
00:01:57.776 --> 00:02:07.067
funnel. Roxy jumped in and went down a long, twisting

30
00:02:07.068 --> 00:02:11.458
slide. Everyone was at the bottom, trapped in a big empty room.

31
00:02:11.459 --> 00:02:14.964
"Rocket Girl!" Terrell said.

32
00:02:14.965 --> 00:02:22.408
"Whew!" Principal Penn wiped her brow. "You found us!"

33
00:02:22.409 --> 00:02:27.961
Roxy brought everyone back to safety.

34
00:02:27.962 --> 00:02:32.555
"Now I have to find Jack Hammer!"

35
00:02:32.556 --> 00:02:35.231
Roxy spotted the builder behind the school.

36
00:02:35.232 --> 00:02:39.243
He was loading school computers into a van.

37
00:02:39.244 --> 00:02:43.806
"Stop right there!" Roxy shouted.

38
00:02:43.807 --> 00:02:47.558
"Never!" Jack Hammer fired a nail gun at Roxy.

39
00:02:47.559 --> 00:02:50.979
"Yikes!" Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

40
00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.591
Jack Hammer ducked.

41
00:02:52.592 --> 00:02:56.670
The beams bounced off his hard hat and shattered a window.

42
00:02:56.671 --> 00:03:01.666
"Ha-ha!" The villain hopped into his van and took off.

43
00:03:01.667 --> 00:03:04.553
Roxy shot after him.

44
00:03:04.554 --> 00:03:09.393
Flying alongside the van, she used her heat vision.

45
00:03:09.394 --> 00:03:11.917
The van's doors melted shut.

46
00:03:11.918 --> 00:03:14.858
"Hey!" Jack Hammer yelled.

47
00:03:14.859 --> 00:03:17.936
Roxy zapped the tires with her eye laser beams.

48
00:03:17.937 --> 00:03:23.357
The van slid through a puddle and stopped.

49
00:03:23.358 --> 00:03:27.895
Jack Hammer tried to open the door. "Oh no! I'm—" "Trapped!"

50
00:03:27.896 --> 00:03:32.581
Roxy smiled. ***

51
00:03:32.582 --> 00:03:36.036
Roxy took Jack Hammer to jail.

52
00:03:36.037 --> 00:03:39.071
Next she flew to his building.

53
00:03:39.072 --> 00:03:42.273
All the stolen items were there.

54
00:03:42.274 --> 00:03:47.457
Finally she returned to school.

55
00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:51.258
"How was indoor recess?" Roxy asked her friends.

56
00:03:51.259 --> 00:03:53.821
"It was great!" Mara said.

57
00:03:53.822 --> 00:03:59.486
"Yeah!" Jack said. "There's a big slide under the gym!"

58
00:03:59.487 --> 00:04:02.815
Roxy and Terrell shot each other a quick look and smiled.

